// Cases of the sithAIInstinct function vectors (see sithAIInstinctFnVec.h for the case fields and the short names).
// Included twice by the case header. Names are <Function>_<state>, edge cases <Function>_edge_<state>.
//
// Defaults: the AI actor (OWNER, thing 0) stands at the origin in sector 0, the other roles at x = 1.5 * (role - 1);
// game time 100000 ms / 100 s; class sight distance 10, heard distance 8, fov -1, rank 0; instinct arguments, state and
// control block fields zero. The first rand() results are chosen with .rnd ('L' low, 'H' high, see the header).

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Listen. Arguments: [0] hear chance, [1] investigate chance, [2] back off distance; state [0] loudness.
// Reacts to HIT_SECTOR, TOUCHED (a thing is the cause) and SOUND (the noise of the awareness sector of the actor).
// The branch of a SOUND event where a hunting actor hears a source (bHunt) reads an uninitialized local in the original
// (see README) and is not covered.
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
