// The snake instincts. The snake (the actor) has a Quetz tail block; the stubs of sithThing_CreateQuetzUserBlock
// (quetz), sithAIUtil_CheckPathToPos (checkPath, hitPos) and sithCollision_FindSectorInRadius decide whether a position is
